id: pm-beads-anzm
title: Adopt --respect-item-release in changelog scripts and bump pm-changelog to 2026.7.24
description: "pm-changelog 2026.7.24 adds --respect-item-release, which makes the single-window generation path (--since-previous-tag --until-release-tag, changelog:check, release notes) honour an item's declared release field instead of trusting closed_at. Without it, closing a tracker whose fix shipped in an earlier release dates months-old work as new, which is why shipped-but-unclosed trackers accumulate: closing them corrupts the changelog. Adopting the flag fleet-wide makes late tracker closure safe and keeps every package's generation path in agreement with --all-release-tags."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: changelog,fleet-consistency,release-hygiene
created_at: "2026-07-24T21:30:13.527Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-27T22:41:02.290Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-27T22:41:02.289Z"
author: claude
acceptance_criteria: "changelog, changelog:full, changelog:check and release:notes all pass --respect-item-release; pm-changelog devDependency is ^2026.7.24; npm run changelog:check is green; CHANGELOG.md content is unchanged by the flag for this repo (no item declares a release yet)"
release: 2026.7.25
resolution: Work completed and released in 2026.7.25. Release attribution set explicitly so pm-changelog --respect-item-release files the entry under 2026.7.25 instead of the current Unreleased section.
expected_result: A closed item whose changelog entry appears under 2026.7.25.
actual_result: "Item remained in_progress with no activity after its work shipped, so the delivery was absent from the changelog while still counting as open work in every fleet audit."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T21:30:14.405Z",claude,"Verified in this repo: pm-changelog 2026.7.24 installed; npm run changelog:full regenerated CHANGELOG.md with the flag active and produced a ZERO-line diff, confirming the flag is a safe no-op until an item declares a release; npm run changelog:check exits 0."
  "2026-07-24T21:42:47.204Z",claude,"Greptile review finding adopted: the daily release workflow invokes pm-changelog DIRECTLY (npx pm-changelog, three times) rather than through the npm scripts, so patching only package.json left the generation path that actually produces the published CHANGELOG.md and RELEASE_NOTES.md without the flag while release:check validated with it. Added --respect-item-release to all three release.yml invocations so generation and validation agree. YAML re-validated."
close_reason: "Retired as shipped: adopting --respect-item-release in the changelog scripts was completed and released in 2026.7.25, but the item was never closed and sat in progress ever since, inflating every fleet audit."
body: ""
